class:: VisualRenderer
summary:: Post/overlay effects and instrumentation for visual views
categories:: Libraries>VisualServer
related:: Classes/VisualServer, Guides/VisualServer

description::

Wraps a view's draw function to add effects (trails, grids, particles, checkerboard) and a performance monitor. Effects are layered by wrapping the existing draw function; link::#-clearEffects:: restores the server's default render.

A singleton is available as link::#*default::.

code::
r = VisualRenderer.default;
r.addTrailEffect(\demo, 0.08);
r.addGrid(\demo, 60, Color.gray(0.15));
r.addPerformanceMonitor(\demo);
::

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: default
Shared singleton (bound to link::Classes/VisualServer::'s default).

method:: new
argument:: server
A link::Classes/VisualServer:: (defaults to link::Classes/VisualServer#*default::).

INSTANCEMETHODS::

private:: init

method:: start
Start the renderer (and its server).

method:: stop
Stop the renderer (and its server).

method:: createView
Create a view via the server, optionally installing a custom render function called after the default render.
argument:: name
argument:: bounds
argument:: background
argument:: customRenderFunc
code::{ |view, viewData, server| ... }:: or code::nil::.

method:: addEffect
Append an arbitrary effect drawn after existing content.
argument:: viewName
argument:: effectFunc
code::{ |view, viewData, server| ... }::.

method:: addTrailEffect
Motion-blur trail: draws a translucent background each frame instead of clearing. Disables the opaque background clear for the view.
argument:: viewName
argument:: alpha
Overlay opacity (default code::0.1::). Smaller = longer trails.

method:: addBlurEffect
Simple motion-blur (delegates to link::#-addTrailEffect:: with alpha 0.2).
argument:: viewName
argument:: amount

method:: addGrid
Draw a grid overlay.
argument:: viewName
argument:: spacing
Pixels (default 50).
argument:: color
Default code::Color.gray(0.3)::.

method:: addParticleSystem
Add a bouncing particle field.
argument:: viewName
argument:: numParticles
Default 50.
argument:: bounds
Default code::Rect(0, 0, 800, 600)::.

method:: addCheckerboard
Draw a checkerboard background.
argument:: viewName
argument:: size
Cell size (default 20).
argument:: color1
argument:: color2

method:: addPerformanceMonitor
Overlay FPS and live node count.
argument:: viewName

method:: clearEffects
Remove all wrapped effects from a view by restoring the server's default draw function and re-enabling background clearing.
argument:: viewName

method:: free
Stop the renderer.

method:: server
method:: views
method:: isRunning

EXAMPLES::

code::
(
v = VisualServer.default; v.start;
v.createView(\fx, Rect(200,200,800,600), Color.black);
r = VisualRenderer.default;
r.addCheckerboard(\fx, 40);
r.addTrailEffect(\fx, 0.06);
r.addPerformanceMonitor(\fx);
)
Vbind(\x, Pwhite(-0.8,0.8), \y, Pwhite(-0.8,0.8), \dur, 0.1, \legato, 6, \view, \fx).vplay;
// later: r.clearEffects(\fx);
::
